flowchart TB
    A["Ask a focused intake question"] --> B{"Answer explicit and unambiguous?"}
    B -- Yes --> C["Record explicit fact"]
    B -- No --> D["Propose value and basis"]
    D --> E{"User confirms?"}
    E -- No --> A
    E -- Yes --> C
    C --> F{"All required facts complete?"}
    F -- No --> A
    F -- Yes --> G["Produce structured fact summary"]
    G --> H["Human review or deterministic evaluation"]
    H -. "Track A does not assign an authoritative tier" .-> H
